Source landscape note: Discovery located a broad, multilingual source universe spanning ruler biographies, academic books and chapters, theses, election studies, human-rights documentation, international-organization reports, economic and social assessments, investigative journalism, and Thai-language repositories. Coverage is strongest for political freedom, military-civil relations, domestic safety, economic governance, and implementation; catastrophic risk and personal-integrity materials are more often country-level or institutional rather than ruler-specific. The list preserves open, preview-only, metadata-only, paywalled, and potentially biased sources as discovery leads only.

